      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "You are an Enterprise AI Advertising Optimization Agent.\n\nAnalyze the campaign data and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nCampaign Summary Metrics:\n{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.summary_metrics}}\n\nCampaign Data:\n{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.campaign_data }}\n\nPlanner Insights:\n{{ $('Planeer Agent').item.json.output }}\n\nCritic Feedback:\n{{ $json.critic_feedback || 'None' }}\n\nRetry Count:\n{{ $json.retry_count || 0 }}\n\nRULES:\n- Output valid JSON only\n- No markdown\n- No explanation\n- No code block\n- No extra text\n\nJSON FORMAT:\n\n{\n  \"campaign_summary\": {\n    \"overall_status\": \"\",\n    \"primary_issue\": \"\",\n    \"optimization_priority\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"issues_detected\": [\n    {\n      \"issue\": \"\",\n      \"severity\": \"\",\n      \"affected_metric\": \"\",\n      \"root_cause\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"optimization_suggestions\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\",\n      \"recommendation\": \"\",\n      \"expected_impact\": \"\",\n      \"priority\": \"\",\n      \"implementation_time\": \"\",\n      \"business_value\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"action_plan\": {\n    \"immediate_actions\": [],\n    \"mid_term_actions\": [],\n    \"long_term_actions\": []\n  },\n  \"executive_summary\": \"\",\n  \"retry_iteration\": 0\n}",
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        304,
